00:22:15.227 --> 00:22:17.097
And then found himself
wanted for killings

00:22:17.258 --> 00:22:19.177
He claimed were the work
of an invisible force,

00:22:19.761 --> 00:22:21.174
Killings carried
out --Get this --

00:22:21.669 --> 00:22:22.838
With a sharp instrument.

00:22:23.027 --> 00:22:24.129
What's the connection to lori?

00:22:24.739 --> 00:22:27.955
A man of religion who openly
preaches against immorality.

00:22:29.387 --> 00:22:32.009
Except this time instead
of saving the whole town,

00:22:32.009 --> 00:22:33.673
He's trying to save his only daughter.

00:22:33.673 --> 00:22:34.909
Reverend sorenson.

00:22:35.567 --> 00:22:36.874
Do you think he's summoning the spirit?

00:22:37.362 --> 00:22:38.052
Maybe.

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:41.928
Or you know how a poltergeist

00:22:41.928 --> 00:22:43.664
Can haunt a person instead of a place?

00:22:44.079 --> 00:22:46.470
The spirit latches onto the
reverend's repressed emotions,

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:47.302
Feeds off them.

00:22:49.138 --> 00:22:50.870
Without the reverend
ever even knowing it.

00:22:53.178 --> 00:22:55.565
Either way,  you should
keep an eye on lori tonight.

00:22:56.179 --> 00:22:57.109
What about you?

00:23:03.036 --> 00:23:04.969
I'm gonna go see if I can
find that unmarked grave.

00:24:04.814 --> 00:24:06.713
Here we go.

00:24:43.950 --> 00:24:45.158
That's it.

00:24:45.744 --> 00:24:49.431
Next time,  I get to watch
the cute girl's house.

00:25:03.578 --> 00:25:04.892
Hello,  preacher.

00:25:22.415 --> 00:25:25.020
I saw you from upstairs.

00:25:26.402 --> 00:25:27.884
What are you doing here?

00:25:29.746 --> 00:25:31.649
I'm keeping an eye on the place.

00:25:34.407 --> 00:25:35.764
I was worried.

00:25:35.764 --> 00:25:36.974
About me?

00:25:37.146 --> 00:25:38.839
Yeah,  sorry.

00:25:40.480 --> 00:25:41.760
No,  it's cool.

00:25:43.357 --> 00:25:44.562
I already called the cops.

00:25:47.244 --> 00:25:49.603
No,  seriously, I think you're sweet,

00:25:50.450 --> 00:25:53.139
Which is probably why you
should run away from me

00:25:53.139 --> 00:25:54.402
As fast as you can.

00:25:56.467 --> 00:25:57.882
Why would you say that?

00:25:58.951 --> 00:26:00.699
It's like I'm cursed or something.

00:26:01.438 --> 00:26:03.219
People around me keep dying.

00:26:07.364 --> 00:26:08.852
I thinkI know how you feel.

00:26:35.929 --> 00:26:37.323
Goodbye,  preacher.

00:26:50.237 --> 00:26:51.811
No one will talk to me anymore...

00:26:52.731 --> 00:26:53.812
Except you.

00:26:54.300 --> 00:26:56.099
The sheriff thinks I'm a suspect.

00:26:57.217 --> 00:26:58.581
And you know what my dad will say?

00:26:58.650 --> 00:27:00.473
"Pave faith."

00:27:00.785 --> 00:27:02.636
What does he know about faith?

00:27:05.447 --> 00:27:07.221
I heard you guys fighting before.

00:27:08.966 --> 00:27:12.398
He's seeing a woman, a married woman.

00:27:12.581 --> 00:27:13.871
I just found out.

00:27:15.189 --> 00:27:17.354
She comes to our
church with her husband,

00:27:17.698 --> 00:27:19.290
I know her kids,

00:27:19.815 --> 00:27:23.263
And he talks to me about
religion, about morality?

00:27:24.999 --> 00:27:26.614
It's like on one hand, you know,

00:27:27.354 --> 00:27:28.897
Just do what you want and be happy,

00:27:29.729 --> 00:27:31.878
But he
taught me --

00:27:31.996 --> 00:27:35.076
Raised me to believe that
if you do something wrong,

00:27:35.156 --> 00:27:36.286
You will get punished.

00:27:40.351 --> 00:27:42.550
I just don't know what to think anymore.

00:28:11.665 --> 00:28:12.672
Sam?

00:28:13.229 --> 00:28:14.924
Lori,  I can'T.

00:28:16.755 --> 00:28:18.600
That someone you lost?

00:28:22.584 --> 00:28:24.129
I'm sorry.

00:28:24.260 --> 00:28:24.976
Lori.

00:28:27.436 --> 00:28:29.271
Come inside,  please.

00:28:30.311 --> 00:28:32.047
I'll come in when I'm ready.

00:28:34.536 --> 00:28:36.411
Ack! Aah!

00:28:44.157 --> 00:28:45.746
No! No!

00:29:01.366 --> 00:29:02.195
Dad!

00:29:08.403 --> 00:29:09.948
It's okay.It's all right.

00:29:09.948 --> 00:29:11.404
It's okay. It's okay.

00:29:14.942 --> 00:29:15.937
We were just talking.

00:29:16.540 --> 00:29:20.285
Then lori's dad came
out, and then he appeared.

00:29:20.667 --> 00:29:24.227
A big man carrying a
weapon,  some kind of a hook?

00:29:24.432 --> 00:29:25.460
Yes,  sir.

00:29:26.198 --> 00:29:27.374
Ever seen him before?

00:29:29.254 --> 00:29:30.095
No,  sir.

00:29:31.842 --> 00:29:34.178
Son,  it seems every time I
turn around,  I'm seeing you.

00:29:36.099 --> 00:29:37.786
I suggest you try to
stay out of trouble.

00:29:39.430 --> 00:29:40.225
Yes,  sir.

00:29:41.199 --> 00:29:42.365
It's all right.I'm with him.

00:29:42.381 --> 00:29:45.030
That's my brother.Hey,  brother.

00:29:49.217 --> 00:29:50.257
Let him through.

00:29:50.589 --> 00:29:51.748
Thanks.

00:29:54.186 --> 00:29:55.165
Go ahead.

00:29:59.787 --> 00:30:00.264
You okay?

00:30:00.264 --> 00:30:00.809
Yeah.

00:30:01.336 --> 00:30:02.345
What the hell happened?

00:30:02.805 --> 00:30:03.606
Hookman.

00:30:03.959 --> 00:30:04.729
You saw him?

00:30:04.766 --> 00:30:05.538
Damn right.

00:30:05.712 --> 00:30:06.653
Why didn't you torch the bones?

00:30:06.653 --> 00:30:10.294
I did. Are you sure it's
the spirit of jacob karns?

00:30:10.294 --> 00:30:12.956
Sure as hell looked like
him. And that's not all.

00:30:13.294 --> 00:30:15.311
I don't think the spirit is
latching onto the reverend.

00:30:15.601 --> 00:30:17.720
Yeah,  the guy wouldn't send
the hookman after himself.

00:30:20.567 --> 00:30:22.088
I think it's latching onto lori.

00:30:22.832 --> 00:30:24.337
Last night she found out that her father

00:30:24.337 --> 00:30:26.186
Is having an affair
with a married woman.

00:30:26.342 --> 00:30:27.326
So what?

00:30:27.326 --> 00:30:28.390
So,  she's upset about it.

00:30:28.838 --> 00:30:30.655
She's upset about the immorality of it.

00:30:30.996 --> 00:30:32.428
She was raised to believe

00:30:32.428 --> 00:30:34.404
That if you do something
wrong, you get punished.

00:30:35.149 --> 00:30:36.853
Okay,  so she's conflicted,

00:30:37.164 --> 00:30:38.694
And the spirit of preacher karns

00:30:38.694 --> 00:30:40.248
Is latching onto her emotions

00:30:40.248 --> 00:30:41.733
And doing the punishing for her.

00:30:41.909 --> 00:30:42.772
Right.

00:30:43.113 --> 00:30:44.533
Rich comes on too strong.

00:30:44.703 --> 00:30:46.552
Taylor tries to make
her into a party girl.

00:30:47.122 --> 00:30:48.389
Dad has an affair.

00:30:49.099 --> 00:30:50.714
Remind me not to piss this girl off.

00:30:52.895 --> 00:30:54.938
But I burned those bones.I
buried them in salt.

00:30:55.190 --> 00:30:56.323
Why didn't that stop him?

00:30:57.637 --> 00:30:59.013
You must've missed something.

00:31:00.695 --> 00:31:02.655
No,  I burned everything in that coffin.

00:31:04.019 --> 00:31:05.247
Did you get the hook?

00:31:07.097 --> 00:31:07.897
The hook?

00:31:09.641 --> 00:31:10.662
It was the murder weapon,

00:31:10.839 --> 00:31:12.614
And in a way it was part of him.

00:31:15.515 --> 00:31:16.846
So,  like the bones,

00:31:16.846 --> 00:31:18.342
The hook is a source of his power.

00:31:19.327 --> 00:31:20.801
So,  if we find the hook...

00:31:21.070 --> 00:31:22.694
We stop the hookman.

00:31:30.795 --> 00:31:31.975
Here's something, I think.

00:31:33.490 --> 00:31:35.342
Log book, iowa state penitentiary.

00:31:35.342 --> 00:31:36.403
"Karns,
jacob --

00:31:36.403 --> 00:31:38.701
Personal affects, disposition there of."

00:31:38.701 --> 00:31:39.564
Does it mention the hook?

00:31:41.345 --> 00:31:43.847
"Upon execution,  all earthly
items shall be remanded

00:31:43.847 --> 00:31:45.082
"To the prisoner's houseof worship,

00:31:45.247 --> 00:31:46.504
St. Barnabas church."

00:31:47.953 --> 00:31:49.541
Isn't that where lori's father preaches?

00:31:49.541 --> 00:31:50.076
Yeah.

00:31:51.368 --> 00:31:52.501
Where lori lives?

00:31:53.079 --> 00:31:54.944
That's why the hookman'sbeen
haunting reverends

00:31:54.944 --> 00:31:57.095
And reverends' daughters
for the past 200 years.

00:31:57.095 --> 00:31:59.157
But if the hook were at
the church or lori's house,

00:31:59.157 --> 00:32:00.453
Don't you think someone
might've seen it?

00:32:00.830 --> 00:32:03.406
I mean,  a blood-Stained,
silver-Handled hook?

00:32:05.441 --> 00:32:06.581
Check the church records.

00:32:09.130 --> 00:32:11.614
"St. Barnabas donations, 1862.

00:32:11.614 --> 00:32:13.285
"Received
--Silver-Handled hook

00:32:13.439 --> 00:32:14.737
"From state penitentiary.

00:32:15.857 --> 00:32:16.624
Reforged."

00:32:18.126 --> 00:32:21.083
They melted it down, made
it into something else.

00:32:36.021 --> 00:32:37.417
All right.We can't take any chances.

00:32:37.417 --> 00:32:38.856
Anything silver goes in the fire.

00:32:39.211 --> 00:32:40.208
I agree.

00:32:41.282 --> 00:32:42.492
Lori's still at the hospital.

00:32:42.492 --> 00:32:43.508
We'll have to break in.

00:32:43.891 --> 00:32:44.974
All right, take your pick.

00:32:45.694 --> 00:32:46.575
I'll take the house.

00:32:47.056 --> 00:32:47.624
Okay.

00:32:50.316 --> 00:32:51.300
Hey.

00:32:52.912 --> 00:32:54.368
Stay out of her underwear drawer.

00:33:12.106 --> 00:33:13.864
I got everything that even looks silver.

00:33:13.864 --> 00:33:14.903
Better safe than sorry.

00:33:29.871 --> 00:33:30.694
Move,  move.

00:34:04.778 --> 00:34:05.643
Lori?

00:34:07.436 --> 00:34:08.706
What are you doing here?

00:34:08.706 --> 00:34:09.547
What is it?

00:34:10.763 --> 00:34:14.676
I've been trying to understand
what's been happening,  why.

00:34:15.023 --> 00:34:17.835
Now I know,  so I'm
praying for forgiveness.

00:34:18.746 --> 00:34:20.310
Forgiveness for what?

00:34:20.785 --> 00:34:21.983
Don't you see?

00:34:22.058 --> 00:34:23.768
I'm to blame for all this.

00:34:24.607 --> 00:34:27.704
I've read in the bible
about avenging angels.

00:34:27.782 --> 00:34:28.190
Trust me.

00:34:28.190 --> 00:34:31.469
This guy --
He's no angel.

00:34:32.403 --> 00:34:34.797
I was so angry at my father.

00:34:35.517 --> 00:34:37.461
Part of me wanted him punished,

00:34:38.695 --> 00:34:40.861
And then he came and he punished him.

00:34:41.075 --> 00:34:42.442
It's not your fault.

00:34:42.946 --> 00:34:44.177
Yes,  it is.

00:34:44.619 --> 00:34:46.179
I don't know how, but it is.

00:34:48.541 --> 00:34:49.582
I killed rich.

00:34:49.924 --> 00:34:50.936
Taylor,  too.

00:34:51.337 --> 00:34:52.929
I nearly killed my father.

00:34:53.363 --> 00:34:54.035
Lori.

00:34:56.131 --> 00:34:57.265
I can see it now.

00:34:58.317 --> 00:35:00.011
They didn't deserve to be punished.

00:35:00.381 --> 00:35:01.245
I do.

00:35:13.147 --> 00:35:14.871
Come on.We got to go.

00:35:24.170 --> 00:35:24.872
Go!

00:35:26.505 --> 00:35:27.234
Come on!

00:35:48.397 --> 00:35:49.182
No!

00:35:58.431 --> 00:36:00.144
Come on,  get up.

00:36:14.913 --> 00:36:15.960
Sam,  drop!

00:36:22.313 --> 00:36:23.620
I thought we got all the silver.

00:36:24.379 --> 00:36:25.482
Why is he still here?

00:36:25.517 --> 00:36:26.868
Maybe we missed something.

00:36:29.776 --> 00:36:31.494
Lori,  where did you getthat chain?

00:36:32.103 --> 00:36:33.280
My father gave it to me.

00:36:33.408 --> 00:36:34.294
Where'd your dad get it?

00:36:34.296 --> 00:36:36.183
It was a church
heirloom.He gave it to me.

00:36:36.916 --> 00:36:37.630
Is it silver?

00:36:37.630 --> 00:36:38.110
Yes.

00:36:55.497 --> 00:36:56.196
Sam.

00:38:06.745 --> 00:38:09.380
And you saw him,  too,
the man with the hook?

00:38:09.404 --> 00:38:11.160
Yes,  I told you.We all saw him.

00:38:11.160 --> 00:38:13.017
We fought him off, and then he ran.

00:38:13.569 --> 00:38:14.293
And that's all?

00:38:15.044 --> 00:38:15.853
Yeah,  that's all.

00:38:19.532 --> 00:38:21.669
Listen, you and
your brother --

00:38:21.669 --> 00:38:23.084
Oh,  don't worry.We're leaving town.

00:38:29.933 --> 00:38:31.006
You gonna be okay?

00:38:31.910 --> 00:38:32.855
Yeah.

00:38:42.989 --> 00:38:44.368
I still don't know what happened,

00:38:45.559 --> 00:38:48.399
But I do know you saved my life.

00:38:49.116 --> 00:38:50.275
My father's,  too.

00:38:50.746 --> 00:38:51.581
Thank you.

00:39:17.115 --> 00:39:18.139
We could stay.



